# Packwand
.packwand-test-instance
packwand-bin/
# Per-pack indexes are generated by `packwand refresh` and rebuilt for publish;
# they are build output, never source.
#
# Matched at any depth below a content root. The previous
# `/<category>/*/*/index.toml` globs pinned the depth exactly, which is how two
# `modpacks/*/*/mods/index.toml` strays ended up committed. Scoped to the
# content roots rather than repo-wide so it cannot swallow an unrelated
# `index.json` such as `docs/packwand/spec/schemas/index.json`.
#
# `index.toml` stays listed so generation-26 leftovers remain ignored until
# `packwand migrate format` removes them.
/modpacks/**/index.json
/modpacks/**/index.toml
/resourcepacks/**/index.json
/resourcepacks/**/index.toml
/datapacks/**/index.json
/datapacks/**/index.toml

# The per-pack content cache backing incremental refresh/lint/registry runs.
.packwand/
apps/packwand/gui/tauri/src-tauri/target/debug
